{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781740/extras/740ea1b7894edaa7593f5b4ba0bb1783.poster.avif?t=1762099139\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781740/extras/740ea1b7894edaa7593f5b4ba0bb1783.webm?t=1762099139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781740/extras/740ea1b7894edaa7593f5b4ba0bb1783.mp4?t=1762099139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Vanquish Evil throws you into dense forests and flaming rings while unleashing wave after wave of monsters. Feels like a survival gauntlet on overdrive.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- IndieSight <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fast-paced, addictive, and full of variety! The upgrade system keeps each run fresh, and the pixel art style looks fantastic. A must-play for action RPG fans!&quot; <br><br>- Awesome Games Review Group<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>FAST-PACED ACTION ROGUELIKE COMBAT</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vanquish Evil aims to take the most fun core gameplay from the ARPG/Roguelite/Survivors-like genres -- and crank up the action to one thousand percent! Where player skill and strategic upgrade choices strongly influence the runs. In addition to auto-abilities, the game is also a Twin-Stick Shooter where certain abilities have manual direction and activation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>THE STORY</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A supernatural cosmic battle is being fought for the mortal realm, and much of the world is already in ruin.<br><br>A final resistance of humanity are brave enough to fight. Many die, and are turned into undead armies who serve the formless evil cosmic presence known as Absolute Darkness (Vile).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascended Light (Veil), a cosmic presence in favor of saving humanity, send Cosmic Guardians to fight alongside the mortal armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final elite army of heroes stand together to fight an apocalyptic war with one common goal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vanquish Evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>GAME DEVELOPMEMENT GOALS</strong></i><br> <br> Creating fun gameplay and high replay value is the goal. The game in it's current state is built to have all character progression in-game for that specific run, which gives the game a lot of replay value. Currently the game has just begun meta progression development. &quot;Meta Items&quot; are now being added as unlocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SPECIAL FEATURES</i></strong><br><br>Stylized hand-drawn pixel art, animation, and background art!<br>Original Music Soundtrack composed and produced by GnarlyTree!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3781740?t=1762099139","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781740/495854a8883e65e9bb89ee94f578a84bef8acd92/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762099139","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781740/ea6566e383bce3b01d33fa1f2aaec9d5912dff58/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762099139","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781740/ea6566e383bce3b01d33fa1f2aaec9d5912dff58/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762099139","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains cartoon gore."},"demos":[{"appid":3788430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781740/extras/740ea1b7894edaa7593f5b4ba0bb1783.poster.avif?t=1762099139\" width=616 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781740/extras/740ea1b7894edaa7593f5b4ba0bb1783.webm?t=1762099139\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3781740/extras/740ea1b7894edaa7593f5b4ba0bb1783.mp4?t=1762099139\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Vanquish Evil throws you into dense forests and flaming rings while unleashing wave after wave of monsters. Feels like a survival gauntlet on overdrive.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- IndieSight <br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fast-paced, addictive, and full of variety! The upgrade system keeps each run fresh, and the pixel art style looks fantastic. A must-play for action RPG fans!&quot; <br><br>- Awesome Games Review Group<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>FAST-PACED ACTION ROGUELIKE COMBAT</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vanquish Evil aims to take the most fun core gameplay from the ARPG/Roguelite/Survivors-like genres -- and crank up the action to one thousand percent! Where player skill and strategic upgrade choices strongly influence the runs. In addition to auto-abilities, the game is also a Twin-Stick Shooter where certain abilities have manual direction and activation. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>THE STORY</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A supernatural cosmic battle is being fought for the mortal realm, and much of the world is already in ruin.<br><br>A final resistance of humanity are brave enough to fight. Many die, and are turned into undead armies who serve the formless evil cosmic presence known as Absolute Darkness (Vile).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascended Light (Veil), a cosmic presence in favor of saving humanity, send Cosmic Guardians to fight alongside the mortal armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The final elite army of heroes stand together to fight an apocalyptic war with one common goal...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vanquish Evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-=-</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>GAME DEVELOPMEMENT GOALS</strong></i><br> <br> Creating fun gameplay and high replay value is the goal. The game in it's current state is built to have all character progression in-game for that specific run, which gives the game a lot of replay value. Currently the game has just begun meta progression development. &quot;Meta Items&quot; are now being added as unlocks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>SPECIAL FEATURES</i></strong><br><br>Stylized hand-drawn pixel art, animation, and background art!<br>Original Music Soundtrack composed and produced by GnarlyTree!</p>","developers":["GnarlyTree"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"2